Package: crate
Title: Canonical Schemas for Changing Data and Provenance Receipts
Version: 0.16.0
Date: 2026-11-11
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3495-2128",
                       affiliation = "New Graph Environment Ltd.")),
    person("New Graph Environment Ltd.", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: Declares a canonical shape for each file or table it
    registers, reads a registered file to that shape whichever known layout
    arrives, and holds data read some other way to the same shape, so a
    change in a registered file's columns or layout is fixed once in crate
    rather than in every reader downstream. Also holds the provenance
    receipt contract: a JSON Schema, RFC 8785 canonical JSON, a table
    fingerprint and test vectors, with R functions that write receipts and
    compare two builds as identical, equivalent within a declared tolerance,
    or different. Under active development.
